  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Poverty, Reforestation, Energy and Climate Change - PROEZA Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is to improve the resilience of poor and extreme poor households vulnerable to the impacts of climate change and to increase the forest cover in environmentally sensitive areas of Eastern Paraguay. Building on preparatory diagnostic work undertaken by INFONA and SEAM with support from the UN REDD Program, the project area comprises 64 Municipal Districts located in eight Departments of Eastern Paraguay: Concepci n, San Pedro, Canindey , Caaguaz , Guair , Alto Paran , Caazap  and Itap a. These 64 Municipal Districts were selected due to their high environmental and social vulnerability</narrative>
  </description>
